cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use camt053-loader-mt940 in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "camt053-loader-mt940: SWIFT MT940 to ISO 20022 camt.053 loader"
abstract: >-
  Converts legacy SWIFT MT940 customer statements into the camt053
  ParsedDocument model, the same object the camt053 library produces from
  native ISO 20022 camt.053 XML, so every downstream consumer in the camt053
  suite works unchanged.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.25"
date-released: "2026-10-29"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/camt053-loader-mt940"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/camt053-loader-mt940/"
keywords:
  - ISO 20022
  - camt.053
  - MT940
  - SWIFT
  - bank statements
